  "ruleText": "Per 102.83 “Seasonal appointment” means “seasonal position” as defined in RSA 98-A:1, VIII, reprinted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.52); ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15 (from Per 102.53); ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.59); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.73), eff 12-1-25",
